title: Ecosystem
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

All the living things in a place, plus the water, soil, air, and weather they depend on, and everything that passes between them.

A pond is one. So is a forest, and so is a city.

Nothing in it is waste. What one thing drops, another eats. See [[Waste = Food]].

A [[BioRegion]] is made of many of them. See [[Systems]], [[Traditional Ecological Knowledge]]
